+ * app's frame); 2 waits for the app's frame first (frame_ms) so the rest is the rotation alone;
+ * 3 also splits the GPU pass into its steps (see KMSDRM_RotStepsDone).
+ */
+static void KMSDRM_RotationStats(Uint64 t0, SDL_bool gpu, double frame_ms)
+{
+    /*
+     * Every 300 frames: the rotation's average and worst time, and the app's frame pacing
+     * (time between swaps; "slow" frames took longer than 1.5 refreshes at 60 Hz). To stderr,
+     * or appended to SDL_KMSDRM_ROTATION_LOG when that names a file (launch scripts often
+     * swallow stderr).
